1790414714 This is not a publishable number, because:
1790414714   no machine this project owns is a c6a.4xlarge, 16 vCPU, 32 GiB, gp2, per rule seven
1790414714   no query has a peak resident set, and rule six wants one. not measured, the timer wraps clickhouse client and the work happens in a server process it did not start
1790414714 
1790414714 Hot here means this engine's own caches are warm, because it is a server
1790414714 that stayed up across the whole suite. That is the stronger kind of hot and
1790414714 it is not the kind the other rows were measured with, so a ratio against
1790414714 them is a ratio between two different quantities.
