1790414715 
1790414715 The ratio is on the query time row, which is what each engine says the
1790414715 queries cost it and what the public board publishes. The wall clock row
1790414715 above it also holds a process start per query, which is this harness and
1790414715 not the engine, and on a small sample it is most of what separates them.
1790414715 
1790414715 Hot here means the tries after the first, with every cache as the first
1790414715 try left it. Servers were restarted before each query's first try, so
1790414715 nothing carries from one query to the next.
